# What NOT to ship in the .vsix. The published package needs only the built
# output (dist/**: host bundle + webview entry + code-split chunks + fonts +
# css), the marketplace icon (media/icon.png), and the docs (README, CHANGELOG,
# LICENSE) — everything else here is source / dev tooling.
#
# NOTE: dist/** is intentionally NOT ignored — it's the whole runtime. Only its
# sourcemaps are dropped (via **/*.map below).

.vscode/**
src/**
node_modules/**
tsconfig*.json
vite.webview.config.ts
vitest.config.ts
Taskfile.yml
.env
.env.example
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/*.map
# Dev docs — shipped on GitHub for contributors, not inside the installed .vsix
# (the Marketplace shows README + CHANGELOG + LICENSE only).
CONTRIBUTING.md
PUBLISHING.md
docs/**
